TITLE: Platform/Auth (REQ-ROO-001 .. REQ-ROO-020)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-001: GET / returns an online body when the database ping succeeds, and returns HTTP 5
STATEMENT: >>>
GET / returns an online body when the database ping succeeds, and returns HTTP 503 with a failure body when the database ping fails.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Platform/Auth
priority: must
type: system
constraints: Live Develop behavior only; Do not import Firebase Requirements.md wording
acceptance_criteria: GET / returns an online body when the database ping succeeds, and returns HTTP 503 with a failure body when the database ping fails.
source_draft: D-REQ-001
ssot_status: published
sot: Develop@a8a1edd713d6db6db61d42ed4eacf6a9e8737d07
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: USR-ROO-001

