constraints: The onboarded-tenant list cache is cleared on tenant create, mark onboarded, billing activation, and the automatic founding-seat revert.; Per-tenant configuration and channel caches are reused only when both are already populated for that tenant.; Tenants without access are still skipped.
acceptance_criteria: A 60-second tick does not call listOnboardedTenants again while the in-process list cache is populated. | A tick does not call loadTenantSettings for a tenant whose configuration and channels are already cached. | Creating a tenant, marking one onboarded, or activating/reverting billing clears the list so the next tick reloads onboarded tenants.
