[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-198
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-198: Onboarding topic cards explain purpose and jump to mapped places
STATEMENT: >>>
Onboarding topic cards explain purpose and jump to mapped places
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
priority: unspecified
type: software
constraints: Auction topic resolves aucreqChannelId; GvG resolves warAnnounceChannelId; General Chat resolves genroomId.; Website topic has no Discord channel field; jump uses the VALHALLA frontend origin with a trailing slash removed.; Unmapped sentence when the topic channel id is empty: This channel is not mapped yet. Ask an officer to paste the ID in Settings.; Back control customId is onboard:back.
acceptance_criteria: Pressing Auction, GvG, or General Chat on the hub yields a private topic card whose title matches the topic and whose body includes that topic's purpose text. | When the mapped channel id for that topic is set, the body mentions the channel and the card offers a Jump to channel link to discord.com/channels/{guildId}/{channelId} plus Back. | When that mapped channel id is empty, the body includes the unmapped Settings sentence, there is no jump link, and Back is present. | Pressing Website yields a topic card with the website purpose; when a frontend origin is configured it offers Open VALHALLA to that origin; when the origin is empty there is no Open VALHALLA link; Back is always present. | Pressing Back from a topic card restores the public hub payload (title Onboarding and the four topic buttons).
source_draft: discord-onboarding-2026-10-05/mints.json
ssot_status: published
sot: Develop@9237b35321389ccfef3ca0768305caa8ba345152
