acceptance_criteria: From the public hub, a known topic button is acknowledged with an ephemeral defer-reply, then the reply is edited to that topic card. | From an already-ephemeral onboarding message, a topic button or Back is acknowledged with defer-update, then the same message is edited to the topic or hub. | Back from a topic returns the hub content in place without posting a new public hub message.
