COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
priority: unspecified
type: system
constraints: Store path is attendance/onboarding_card.; Stored fields are channelId, messageId, and updatedAt.; Edit is attempted only when stored channelId equals the target channel id and messageId is present.
acceptance_criteria: After a successful send or edit of the hub, the tenant store writes attendance/onboarding_card with that channelId, messageId, and an updatedAt timestamp. | A later deploy to the same channel edits the stored message's hub payload when Discord still has that message, and refreshes the pointer without requiring a new public message. | If the stored message cannot be fetched or edited, deploy sends a new hub message and updates the pointer to the new messageId.
