domain: Discord bot/Channels
priority: unspecified
type: system
constraints: Root route is GET /api/deploy-onboarding-card; Settings Send uses that root route.; Alias route is GET /api/attendance/deploy-onboarding-card.; Target channel is the tenant onboardingChannelId resolved via the DISCORD_ONBOARDING_CHANNEL_ID alias (tenant map only).; Live HTTP handlers do not call evaluateDeployOnboardingGate; they use officer checks plus deployPublicOnboardingCard error mapping.
acceptance_criteria: An authenticated officer calling GET /api/deploy-onboarding-card posts or edits the Onboarding hub in the tenant's mapped onboarding channel and returns success. | GET /api/attendance/deploy-onboarding-card performs the same Discord deploy for an officer and returns a JSON success envelope with the deploy result. | Unauthenticated callers receive 401; authenticated non-officers receive 403. | Empty onboarding channel mapping yields 400 without posting. | Bot not ready or Discord circuit/IP block yields 503 without posting. | Mapped id that the gateway cannot locate yields 404 without posting. | Game Settings shows an Onboarding Send control that triggers the root deploy route.
