[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-176
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-176: GVG Readiness stays on the cycle War after the RSVP deadline
STATEMENT: >>>
GVG Readiness stays on the cycle War after the RSVP deadline
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Scheduler/RSVP
priority: unspecified
type: system
constraints: A cycle targets the war only when needsSetup is not true, the cycle is not force-locked, and warDate, activeEventId, and warStartTime are all set.; The instance is loaded or materialized for the week of that war date, not blindly for the current week.; Board fingerprint includes event key, date, timeStart, title, locked-vs-open, and each member RSVP status.
acceptance_criteria: When the raid cycle targets a war, the GVG Readiness card shows that war even after its RSVP deadline, and the confirm/leave buttons are locked. | If that war's scheduler instance is missing or isCancelled, the card target is missing and does not fall through to the Set Active published composition or the next open RSVP. | When the cycle does not target a war, the card still prefers the anchored published composition, else the next event with an open RSVP window. | The readiness message is edited when the war date, start time, title, or locked/open flag changes, even if the RSVP map is unchanged.
source_draft: delta-2026-10-03/mints.json
ssot_status: published
sot: Develop@9b8e7ae9ca2f9ccf046c5b609cdda545ced6eae9
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: USR-ROO-028

