constraints: isRaidEnabled(event) selects event.raid.phases[3]; otherwise event.phases[3] is used.; Scheduler business-hours fallback when phase 3 is missing remains 20:55–22:15. The day-focus time fallback remains 21:30–23:00.
acceptance_criteria: Scheduler weekly blocks, business-hour shading, and the RSVP deadline clock use raid.phases[3] day/time for a raid-enabled event, not a legacy phases[3] on the event root. | Raid Compose's generated war dates and default start time use that same raid phase 3.
