[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-183
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-183: Scheduler does not re-GET commitments while the page stays open
STATEMENT: >>>
Scheduler does not re-GET commitments while the page stays open
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Scheduler/RSVP
priority: unspecified
type: software
constraints: The page asks settings for fields events, specialEventCategories, and timezone only.; The commitments request includes weekMonday when the page already has one.
acceptance_criteria: Leaving the Scheduler open does not repeat GET /api/attendance/commitments on a timer. | Commitments load when the page opens, and again when weekMonday changes. Changing week clears the stored ETag before that fetch so the new week is not answered with the previous week's 304.
