[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-189
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-189: Attendance-card RSVP posts a GEN-room line at most once a minute
STATEMENT: >>>
Attendance-card RSVP posts a GEN-room line at most once a minute
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Scheduler/RSVP
priority: unspecified
type: system
constraints: Cooldown key is snowflake id plus the card composite key. Window is 60 seconds.; The line uses the raid cycle's activeEventTitle and warDate, not the button's event key. Missing title becomes 'the raid'. Missing name becomes 'A raider'.; Date format is Mon DD, YYYY (example shape Sep 23, 2026). Unparseable date becomes an em dash.; Confirmed is Available. Leave is Unavailable. If DISCORD_WARANNOUNCE_CHANNEL_ID is set, the line ends with ' Confirm yours at <#id>.' Otherwise that clause is omitted.; A no-op press that does not change status does not announce. A failed applyAttendanceDecision does not announce.
acceptance_criteria: After a member's GVG card press changes them to Confirmed, GEN room receives the Available sentence for the cycle war title and war date. | A press that changes them to Leave receives the Unavailable sentence. | A second successful change for the same member and card within 60 seconds does not send another GEN-room line.
source_draft: delta-2026-10-03/mints.json
ssot_status: published
sot: Develop@9b8e7ae9ca2f9ccf046c5b609cdda545ced6eae9
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: USR-ROO-028

