[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-175
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-175: War Room cycle stays on the next War whose end is still ahead
STATEMENT: >>>
War Room cycle stays on the next War whose end is still ahead
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Raid compose/Party
priority: unspecified
type: system
constraints: Ended means now is strictly after phase-3 timeEnd on the war end date in the guild timezone.; The search walks at most three Monday-weeks forward.; While currentPhase is 3, that occurrence is kept even if its end has passed.; Phase-1 prep date is the chosen war date walked backward (weekday wrap of 7) to the phase-1 weekday, not a separately shifted week.
acceptance_criteria: After a war's phase-3 end, and when the cycle is not in phase 3, warDate, war start/end, and published id roll to the next occurrence that has not ended. | A Tuesday war that has already ended does not remain the current war just because Sunday sits at both the start of the minute circle and the end of the Monday week. | During phase 3 the cycle keeps the in-progress war date even after warEndsAt. | If no occurrence qualifies within three weeks, the cycle falls back to the war weekday in the current Monday-week.
source_draft: delta-2026-10-03/mints.json
ssot_status: published
sot: Develop@9b8e7ae9ca2f9ccf046c5b609cdda545ced6eae9
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: USR-ROO-031

