[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-191
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-191: War Room publish keeps only the Raid Party config assigned in settings
STATEMENT: >>>
War Room publish keeps only the Raid Party config assigned in settings
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Raid compose/Party
priority: unspecified
type: system
constraints: Target config id is cycle.configId. Missing id fails the publish with 'No Raid Party config is assigned in Game Settings.'; Sync runs in phases 1 through 3 only when the phase is 1 or 2, or no Active live session exists. During phase 3 with an Active live session the published snapshot is left alone.; Already holding exactly that one config still sets the published anchor active.
acceptance_criteria: After a successful war-room publish sync, the published composition's grids contain only the settings Raid Party config; other configs that were on that published id are removed. | If that config is already the only one present, it is not re-added, and the anchor is set to that published id. | During phase 3 while a live session is Active, automation does not add or remove configs on the published composition.
