[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-192
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-192: War Room republish and live-raid auto-start run once per cycle key
STATEMENT: >>>
War Room republish and live-raid auto-start run once per cycle key
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Raid compose/Party
priority: unspecified
type: system
constraints: Cycle key is currentPhase, activeEventId, publishedId, configId, and warDate joined by '|'.; The live-start key is recorded before createLiveRaidFromPublished returns. An empty warRoomIds list returns before the key is recorded, so a later non-empty list can still start.; ensureGvgReadinessBoardIfMissing runs only inside the successful publish branch, not on every minute tick.
acceptance_criteria: While the cycle key is unchanged, later 60-second ticks do not call publish/set-active again. | A failed live-raid auto-start is not attempted again on later ticks for that same cycle key. | A successful auto-start is not repeated for that same cycle key. | The GVG readiness board is not refreshed every minute; it is ensured only when that publish branch runs.
source_draft: delta-2026-10-03/mints.json
ssot_status: published
sot: Develop@9b8e7ae9ca2f9ccf046c5b609cdda545ced6eae9
