priority: unspecified
type: system
constraints: Watch starts unknown. The first automatic end-time check that does not find status Active sets the watch to absent. Active sets it to active.; createLiveRaidFromPublished of a new session, and a war-room read that finds Active, set the watch active. End and cancel set it absent.; This watch is in-process memory. Another process is not visible to it.
acceptance_criteria: After this process has observed that no Active live session exists, later 60-second ticks do not query attendance/live_session until this process starts one or otherwise marks the watch active. | While the watch is active and monitoringEndsAt is in the past, the session is still archived automatically (REQ-ROO-144) and then the watch is marked absent. | A non-Active document is treated as absent and is not polled again.
source_draft: delta-2026-10-03/mints.json
ssot_status: published
sot: Develop@9b8e7ae9ca2f9ccf046c5b609cdda545ced6eae9
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: USR-ROO-034

