TITLE: Data isolation (REQ-ROO-205 .. REQ-ROO-210)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ROO-205
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-205: Each game's records are stored and read only as that game, and no-game code is r
STATEMENT: >>>
Each game's records are stored and read only as that game, and no-game code is refused
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Data isolation
priority: unspecified
type: software
constraints: (none)
acceptance_criteria: Roster, auction requests, awards, loot history, commitments, schedule instances, special events and documents saved from Origin cannot be read or changed from Ragnarok 3, and those saved from Ragnarok 3 cannot be read or changed from Origin, in the same workspace. | Records saved before this change count as Origin; Adventurer Guild documents count as Adventurer Guild. | A request, Discord card press or background job that reads or writes game data with no game set is refused with a 'select a game' error and reads or writes nothing; it never falls back to Origin.
