UID: REQ-ROO-207
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-ROO-207: Game settings saved apart from shared workspace settings
STATEMENT: >>>
Game settings saved apart from shared workspace settings
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Data isolation
priority: unspecified
type: software
constraints: Shared keys: guild name, timezone, admin roles, logo.
acceptance_criteria: Saving one game's settings does not change another game's settings or the shared workspace keys (except Origin, which still saves the shared keys). | Reading a game's settings gives defaults, then that game's defaults, then shared workspace values, then the game's own values, later ones winning. | After a game's settings are saved, the next read for that game returns the new values and other games' reads are unaffected.
