[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-R3-006
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-R3-006: R3 SPA lives under `/games/ragnarok-3` with no setupPath; `gameIdForPath` matches R3 first.
STATEMENT: >>>
R3 has `pathPrefix` `/games/ragnarok-3`, `settingsPath` `/games/ragnarok-3/settings`, and no `setupPath`. `gameIdForPath` returns `ragnarok-3` for those routes and must not fall through to Origin.
<<<
